==English==
{{wp|IS}}
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₁es-}}

===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|en|id=be|:inh|enm:is<id:be>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|is}}, from {{inh|en|ang|is}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*ist}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*isti}} (a form of {{der|en|gem-pro|*wesaną||to be}}), from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₁ésti||is}}.

Cognate with {{cog|fy|is||is}}, {{cog|nl|is||is}}, {{cog|de|ist||is}}, {{cog|yi|איז||is}}, {{cog|af|is||am, are, is}} {{cog|gmq-osw|är}}, {{m|gmq-osw|er}}, {{cog|non|er}}, {{m|non|es}}.

Further cognates include, among others, {{cog|la|sum|est}}, {{cog|grc|ἐστί}}, {{cog|sa|अस्ति}}, {{cog|fa|است||tr=ast}}, {{cog|ru|есть}}, all with the same meaning.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/ɪz/|a=UK,US,CA,AusE}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-is.ogg|a=US}}
* {{IPA|en|/əz/|a=NZ}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɪz/|/ɪdʒ/<q:affricated>|a=North India}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɪs/|a=South India}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪz|s=1}}

====Verb====
{{head|en|verb forms}}

# {{infl of|en|be||s-verb-form}}
#: {{ux|en|He '''is''' a doctor.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2012|author=Robert Moore|title=Where the Gold is Buried, a legend of Old Fort Niagara|ISBN=9781105635878|page=137|passage="It's not two weeks yet," I reminded her, hoping that might somehow cheer her. {{...}} "Tomorrow '''is''' two weeks," Ruth said in a distant voice, staring into the flames.}}
# {{lb|en|now|colloquial}} {{n-g|Used in phrases with existential {{m|en|there}} (also {{m|en|here}} and {{m|en|where}}) when the semantic subject is plural}}.
#: {{ux|en|There '''is''' three of them there.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Love's Labour's Lost|V|ii|141|2|''Ber.'' There '''is''' five in the firſt ſhew, / ''Ken.'' You are deceiued, tis not so.}}
# {{lb|en|dialectal}} {{inflection of|en|be||||pres|indc}}; [[am]], [[are]], [[is]].
#* {{quote-song|en|year=2001|title=Witness (1 Hope)|artist={{w|Roots Manuva}}|album=Run Come save me|passage=Let the whole world know we''''s''' on some off-key tip}}
#* {{quote-song|en|year=2016|title={{w|Don't Hurt Yourself (Beyoncé song)|Don't Hurt Yourself}}|artist=w:Beyoncé|album=Lemonade|passage=Who the fuck do you think I '''is'''? / You ain't married to no average bitch, boy}}
#* {{quote-song|en|year=2022|title=Plan B|artist={{w|Megan Thee Stallion}}|passage=Nigga, yeah, you''''s''' a bitch}}
#* {{quote-song|en|year=2023|title={{w|Barbie World}}|artist={{w|Nicki Minaj}}; {{w|Ice Spice}}|album=Barbie: The Album|passage=Like Jazzie, Stacie, Nicki / All of the Barbies '''is''' pretty / All of the Barbies '''is''' bad}}

